THE NO-SUBSCRIPTION SLOP LICENSE (NSSL) v1.0

This software was vibecoded into existence by one person who refused to pay
$20/month to talk to their computer. It is Silicon Valley slop made at home:
same slop, zero MRR.

The spirit of this license, in plain words:

  1. Use it, fork it, sell it, rename it, put it in your startup's pitch deck.
  2. If you turn it into a $20/month subscription, you have become the thing
     it was built to avoid. That is allowed. It is also embarrassing.
  3. It was vibecoded. If it deletes your clipboard, mishears "ship it" as
     "sh*t", or pastes your grocery list into a board meeting, that is between
     you and the whisper model.

